# Allowlist: the Dockerfile only needs the Rust crate and the image's entrypoint, so
# send nothing else as build context (no JS workspaces, node_modules, website or .git).
*
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/
!docker-entrypoint.sh

# Inside the crate: build output, and local files git ignores (the old
# CWD-relative model cache is hundreds of MB; env and key files never belong in
# a build context).
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen
**/.fastembed*
**/.callimachus
**/.env*
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.log
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.DS_Store
